        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Curse of Drowning"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(curse, primal, water)\n\nWhen a creature slays a shoal linnorm, it must succeed at a 38 Will save or become cursed. As long as the curse of drowning persists, the character must spend 3 actions when drinking any liquid.\n\nAttempting to drink liquid faster causes the victim to begin drowning, immediately running out of air and falling unconscious."
            },
